    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>18环境，因nvme磁盘寿命到期，对磁盘进行了 更换，更换为关机更换，系统启动后无法正常识别到nvme盘符，硬件已成功识别。需要研发确认问题原因并修复</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>评论</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-472339"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948"
                id="word_commented_5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5e44fa3fa17f930c9b944948">
                    朱永安
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">26/十二月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-472339"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/385672" alt="企业微信截图_17666643884478-20251225-120628.png" width="1072" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/385671" alt="企业微信截图_17666644501840-20251225-120730.png" width="449" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>硬件层面已识别，对应的nvme盘符未出现，需要解决。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-472341"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5de5f414cdc2d20d053804cc"
                id="word_commented_5de5f414cdc2d20d053804cc"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5de5f414cdc2d20d053804cc">
                    于宸
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">26/十二月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-472341"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>查看node-44上dmesg，nvme pci设备相关信息：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[root@node-44 ~]# journalctl -k | grep nvme
Dec 25 13:50:05 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: pci function 0000:04:00.0
Dec 25 13:50:05 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: Could not set queue count (16390)
Dec 25 13:50:05 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: IO queues not created
Dec 25 19:30:57 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: resetting controller
Dec 25 19:30:57 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: Could not set queue count (16390)
Dec 25 19:30:57 node-44.domain.tld kernel: nvme nvme0: IO queues not created
[root@node-44 ~]#
[root@node-44 ~]# nvme list
Node             SN                   Model                                    Namespace Usage                      Format           FW Rev
---------------- -------------------- ---------------------------------------- --------- -------------------------- ---------------- --------
[root@node-44 ~]# 
[root@node-44 ~]# lspci -vknn -s 0000:04:00.0
04:00.0 Non-Volatile memory controller [0108]: Intel Corporation NVMe Datacenter SSD [3DNAND, Beta Rock Controller] [8086:0a54] (prog-if 02 [NVM Express])
        Subsystem: Intel Corporation NVMe Datacenter SSD [3DNAND] ME AIC (P4600) [8086:4714]
        Flags: bus master, fast devsel, latency 0, IRQ 83, NUMA node 0, IOMMU group 84
        Memory at 91a00000 (64-bit, non-prefetchable) [size=16K]
        Expansion ROM at 91a10000 [disabled] [size=64K]
        Capabilities: [40] Power Management version 3
        Capabilities: [50] MSI-X: Enable+ Count=129 Masked-
        Capabilities: [60] Express Endpoint, MSI 00
        Capabilities: [a0] MSI: Enable- Count=1/1 Maskable- 64bit+
        Capabilities: [100] Advanced Error Reporting
        Capabilities: [150] Virtual Channel
        Capabilities: [180] Power Budgeting &lt;?&gt;
        Capabilities: [190] Alternative Routing-ID Interpretation (ARI)
        Capabilities: [270] Device Serial Number 55-cd-2e-41-50-e5-52-13
        Capabilities: [2a0] Secondary PCI Express
        Capabilities: [2d0] Latency Tolerance Reporting
        Capabilities: [310] L1 PM Substates
        Kernel driver in use: nvme
        Kernel modules: nvme

[root@node-44 ~]# cat /sys/class/nvme/nvme0/
address            firmware_rev       power/             serial             subsystem/
cntlid             kato               queue_count        sqsize             transport
dev                model              rescan_controller  state              uevent
device/            numa_node          reset_controller   subsysnqn
[root@node-44 ~]# 
[root@node-44 ~]# cat /sys/class/nvme/nvme0/queue_count
1
[root@node-44 ~]#
[root@node-44 ~]# echo 1 | sudo tee /sys/bus/pci/devices/0000:04:00.0/remove
1
[root@node-44 ~]# sleep 2
[root@node-44 ~]# echo 1 | sudo tee /sys/bus/pci/rescan
1
[root@node-44 ~]#
[root@node-44 ~]# dmesg | grep nvme
[63887.123134] nvme nvme0: Device shutdown incomplete; abort shutdown
[63889.191258] nvme nvme0: pci function 0000:04:00.0
[63889.195381] nvme nvme0: Could not set queue count (16390)
[63889.195490] nvme nvme0: IO queues not created
[root@node-44 ~]#</pre>
</div></div>

<p>通过dmesg，可以看到nvme driver在初始化流程中报错，设置队列的个数太大了：“Could not set queue count (16390)”，</p>

<p>需要继续要看下nvme driver代码流程并调试下</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-472358"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:bf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a"
                id="word_commented_712020:bf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Abf8a4fd7-a087-41f4-935b-f55b3414a97a">
                    梁家源
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">26/十二月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-472358"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>	/*
	 * Degraded controllers might return an error when setting the queue
	 * count.  We still want to be able to bring them online and offer
	 * access to the admin queue, as that might be only way to fix them up.
	 */
	if (status &gt; 0) {
		dev_err(ctrl-&gt;device, "Could not set queue count (%d)\n", status);//这里的数字是状态，不是请求的队列数量。
		*count = 0;
	} else {
		nr_io_queues = min(result &amp; 0xffff, result &gt;&gt; 16) + 1;
		*count = min(*count, nr_io_queues);
	}</pre>
</div></div>

<p>{{<span class="error">&#91;63889.195381&#93;</span> nvme nvme0: Could not set queue count (16390) }}<br/>
{{16390}}是表示nvme命令的返回状态，不是请求的队列数量。 16390 转化成 16进制是 0x4006。0x4006 对应的含义：</p>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/385694" alt="image-20251226-084519.png" width="833" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>说明是硬件内部的问题。</p>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[root@node-44 ~]# smartctl -a /dev/nvme0
smartctl 7.1 2020-04-05 r5049 [x86_64-linux-4.18.0-372.19.1.es8_10.x86_64] (local build)
Copyright (C) 2002-19, Bruce Allen, Christian Franke, www.smartmontools.org

=== START OF INFORMATION SECTION ===
Model Number:                       INTEL SSDPEDKE020T7
Serial Number:                      PHLE922100872P0IGN
Firmware Version:                   QDV101D1
PCI Vendor/Subsystem ID:            0x8086
IEEE OUI Identifier:                0x5cd2e4
Total NVM Capacity:                 69,793,218,560 [69.7 GB]
Unallocated NVM Capacity:           0
Controller ID:                      0
Number of Namespaces:               0
Local Time is:                      Fri Dec 26 15:21:18 2025 CST
Firmware Updates (0x02):            1 Slot
Optional Admin Commands (0x0006):   Format Frmw_DL
Optional NVM Commands (0x0006):     Wr_Unc DS_Mngmt
Maximum Data Transfer Size:         32 Pages
Warning  Comp. Temp. Threshold:     70 Celsius
Critical Comp. Temp. Threshold:     80 Celsius

Supported Power States
St Op     Max   Active     Idle   RL RT WL WT  Ent_Lat  Ex_Lat
 0 +    25.00W       -        -    0  0  0  0        0       0

=== START OF SMART DATA SECTION ===
Read NVMe SMART/Health Information failed: NVMe Status 0x4006</pre>
</div></div>

<p>通过smartctl -a /dev/nvme0 命令也可以看出 确实存在硬件问题，爆出来的状态码也是 NVMe Status 0x4006。</p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
于尚斌 通过JIRA 1001.0.0-SNAPSHOT#100290-rev:57a0ca5b4a0bb0ac5f3fee4764acb1c14e4d7e71 生成于 Fri Dec 26 10:30:16 UTC 2025。

